libmackie (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The packages install their licence and a short README and no other
    markdown; their descriptions point to openmixer.org.
  * The commit message and private reference checks run from the shared
    FreeMixer/.github workflow; no copy is kept here (#4).
  * No change to the library or its ABI.

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0100

libmackie (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: the Mackie Control codec ported from the TypeScript X-Touch
    adapter, byte for byte: faders, buttons and lamps, V-Pots and rings, the jog
    wheel, meters, scribble strips and backlights, the seven-segment displays,
    the device reset and the host-connection handshake. Held to golden bytes
    generated from the TypeScript encoders and to the handshake captured live
    on an X-Touch.

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0100
